description:
Renji Bijoy asked Meta, Google, and Microsoft to build spatial computing hardware. They all said no — so he built it himself. Now they're all following.

@Renji.Bijoy shares the founder story behind Immersed and the Visor headset. Full episode: immersed.com/POD

